\"securityContext to check for missing hardening\",\n      \"file\": \"deploy/k8s/deployment.yaml\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"text\": \"securityContext:\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does this securityContext set allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, runAsNonRoot: true, readOnlyRootFilesystem: true, and drop ALL capabilities? A missing field defaults to the permissive value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H004\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P27\",\n      \"item\": \"B11\",\n      \"title\": \"securityContext to check for missing hardening\",\n      \"file\": \"deploy/k8s/deployment.yaml\",\n      \"line\": 68,\n      \"text\": \"securityContext:\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does this securityContext set allowPrivilegeEscalation: false, runAsNonRoot: true, readOnlyRootFilesystem: true, and drop ALL capabilities? A missing field defaults to the permissive value.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H005\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P41\",\n      \"item\": \"B07\",\n      \"title\": \"Timeout or budget defined\",\n      \"file\": \"app/extractor.py\",\n      \"line\": 26,\n      \"text\": \"MAX_TURNS = 4\",\n      \"ask\": \"Search for every read of this name: is it actually passed to the call or loop it should bound, and does exceeding it stop the run outside the model's control?\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H006\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P48\",\n      \"item\": \"R05\",\n      \"title\": \"Cache keyed without user or tenant\",\n      \"file\": \"app/settings.py\",\n      \"line\": 59,\n      \"text\": \"@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does the cache key include the tenant and user? If not, one tenant's answer or tool result can be served to another.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"H007\",\n      \"pattern\": \"P48\",\n      \"item\": \"R05\",\n      \"title\": \"Cache keyed without user or tenant\",\n      \"file\": \"app/tools/__init__.py\",\n      \"line\": 53,\n      \"text\": \"@lru_cache(maxsize=1)\",\n      \"ask\": \"Does the cache key include the tenant and user? If no